    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To synthesize plain text to an audio byte stream using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Polly service. Amazon Polly is a text-to-speech service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. I will import the necessary module from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Polly client to synthesize the speech. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864123568,
